    "---\n",
    "## 8 · Univariate fidelity\n",
    "\n",
    "For each synthesiser, KDE overlays compare the real and synthetic distributions of all four variables in a single figure. The Kolmogorov–Smirnov statistics reported alongside these plots are treated as supporting evidence rather than a decision rule: with n = 167, the test has only moderate power, so it is read together with the visual overlap and the effect size, not in isolation."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 10,
   "id": "b35855ca",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
